    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Teruteru Bouze named &quot;Terunyan&quot; loves The Sun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As usual, Terunyan is wandering around and collecting elementals as a hobby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terunyan to Amanoiwato is a rhythm game in which Terunyan straight ahead and collects elementals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elementals can be efficiently gathered by collecting them in rhythm to the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can collect elementals that come to the judgment area near Terunyan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, failure to collect elementals will reduce Terunyan's motivation and increase the density of the fog in the landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, if Terunyan's motivation reaches zero, Terunyan will return home and the game will be over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good news for those who want to reduce the fog and enjoy the cute appearance of Terunyan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Ternyan collects elementals, it accumulates energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can use that energy to activate skills and blow away the fog that occurs when you fail.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Teruteru Bouze named &quot;Terunyan&quot; loves The Sun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As usual, Terunyan is wandering around and collecting elementals as a hobby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terunyan to Amanoiwato is a rhythm game in which Terunyan straight ahead and collects elementals. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elementals can be efficiently gathered by collecting them in rhythm to the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can collect elementals that come to the judgment area near Terunyan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, failure to collect elementals will reduce Terunyan's motivation and increase the density of the fog in the landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, if Terunyan's motivation reaches zero, Terunyan will return home and the game will be over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good news for those who want to reduce the fog and enjoy the cute appearance of Terunyan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When Ternyan collects elementals, it accumulates energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You can use that energy to activate skills and blow away the fog that occurs when you fail.</p>",
